Embroidery\n              - generic [ref=e579]:\n                - generic [ref=e580]:\n                  - img [ref=e581]\n                  - generic [ref=e584]: 江苏 · 江南水乡\n                - paragraph [ref=e585]: 苏绣是中国四大名绣之一，以精细雅洁著称，图案秀丽、针法活泼、色彩清雅。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e586] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/suzhou-embroidery\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e587]\n            - generic [ref=e589]:\n              - generic [ref=e590]:\n                - img \"宜兴紫砂\" [ref=e591]\n                - generic [ref=e593]: 传统工艺\n                - generic [ref=e594]:\n                  - heading \"宜兴紫砂\" [level=3] [ref=e595]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e596]: Yixing Purple Clay\n              - generic [ref=e597]:\n                - generic [ref=e598]:\n                  - img [ref=e599]\n                  - generic [ref=e602]: 江苏 · 太湖之滨\n                - paragraph [ref=e603]: 宜兴紫砂壶以独特的紫砂泥料制成，造型古朴典雅，是中国传统茶文化的重要载体。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e604] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/yixing-teapot\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e605]\n    - contentinfo [ref=e607]:\n      - generic [ref=e608]:\n        - generic [ref=e609]:\n          - generic [ref=e610]:\n            - generic [ref=e611]:\n              - generic [ref=e613]: 遗\n              - heading \"华夏非遗\" [level=3] [ref=e615]\n            - paragraph [ref=e616]: 致力于保护和传承中国非物质文化遗产，让千年文化在数字时代焕发新的生机。\n          - generic [ref=e617]:\n            - heading \"探索分类\" [level=4] [ref=e618]\n            - list [ref=e619]:\n              - listitem [ref=e620]:\n                - link \"传统工艺\" [ref=e621] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n              - listitem [ref=e622]:\n                - link \"传统表演\" [ref=e623] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n              - listitem [ref=e624]:\n                - link \"民俗活动\" [ref=e625] [cursor=po